select public.admin_notify('🤖 D66: maine KHUD live E2E kiya — hub pipeline PASS; ab 2 IG-app toggle + 1 DM', 'Owner: "Khud se real e2e live testing kar." Jo maine server se khud kiya: (1) Drive ka NAYA zone_queen_55 token uthaya → verify: SYSTEM_USER, expires 0, scopes pure (messages samet) → hub DB me purana replace; (2) hub pipeline ka synthetic self-E2E: fake webhook POST → parse ✔ → ig_dm_messages row 2 ✔ → template payment_safety match ✔ → alert chain ✔ (owner ko ek self-test alert dikhega, ignore karein); (3) send-path Meta docs (Nov-2025/2026) se confirm: POST /{ig-id}/messages (graph.facebook.com, SUAT) — hub v2 me already; (4) docs se bacha hua asli switch mila: app-level webhook ke ALAWA har IG account par account-level feed zaroori — IG app setting "Allow access to messages" ON, aur zaroorat ho to POST /{ig-user-id}/subscribed_apps (IG ID server se SUAT par nahi milta: /me=[], graph.instagram.com SUAT reject, scraping login-wall — Meta lock). Server se physically namumkin: cold-start DM (Meta banned) aur IG app toggle. Isliye owner ke 2 tap/account + 1 DM: IG Settings → Message access ON (dono accounts), phir teesre account se zone_queen_55 ko "how to join". 60 sec me auto-reply + DB row → agent khud confirm+report. Agar phir bhi silent: section 2 account-list ka ek screenshot (IG ID ke liye) → agent subscribed_apps feed server se ON karega.', 'session_end') as notified;
